---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import CTA from "@/components/sections/CTA.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Learn about Cllipify's mission to democratize video creation with AI."
>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 lg:pt-40">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h1 class="animate-on-scroll text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-6">
          Making Video Creation
          <br /><span class="text-orange">Accessible</span> to Everyone
        </h1>
        <p class="animate-on-scroll text-lg text-muted-foreground" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
          We believe everyone should be able to bring their ideas to life through video.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="space-y-12 animate-on-scroll" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Our Mission</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Cllipify was founded to democratize video creation. We saw how powerful video
            content could be for communication, marketing, and storytelling, but also how
            inaccessible traditional video production remained for most people and businesses.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">The Problem We Solve</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Creating professional videos traditionally requires expensive software,
            specialized skills, and hours of editing time. For small businesses, content
            creators, and teams without dedicated video production resources, this creates
            a significant barrier to entry.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Our Approach</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            By combining cutting-edge AI with an intuitive interface, we've made it possible
            for anyone to create stunning videos in minutes. Simply describe what you want,
            and our AI handles the rest — from generating visuals to adding transitions
            and effects.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Looking Forward</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            We're constantly improving our AI models and adding new features based on
            community feedback. Our goal is to make Cllipify the go-to platform for
            anyone who wants to create professional video content quickly and easily.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTA />
</BaseLayout>
